[OC]|cffffcc00Gold check for the Loch Modan and Ironforge shopping:|r you have about 65-85s of quest money by now plus what you vendored (Dun Morogh and the loch so far). The list below costs about 85s all in. Order if short: Strong Fishing Pole and the Longjaw recipe (11s, your food), Journeyman Cooking 5s, Journeyman First Aid 5s + Heavy Linen 1s, firewood 5s, Two-Handed Axes 10s, the four level-12 spells 32s (Healing Wave 3 and Ancestral Spirit first), bear recipe + spices 3s 50c, Journeyman Fishing 5s, a bag 5s. Anything you cannot afford waits for the chapter 03 Ironforge pass at 15. Sell every grey and unworn white before the tram. Vendor prices here are four times the Wowhead Forever sell price - check at the counter. Auction House in Ironforge: smelt everything (free Mining skill) and sell the surplus bars and Rough/Coarse Stone there in 20-stacks, never to a vendor (a copper bar vendors for 10c); keep every Pyrite, 20 Copper Bars for a Waylaid crate, and 10 Copper + 10 Tin for Morhan's bronze at 21. Light Leather is banked for 25, not sold.
